	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Search GitHub from Alfred, scoped to your org.

gh repo api         → open myorg/api, or search repos
gh pr fix login     → pull requests matching "fix login"
gh review           → open PRs waiting on your review
gh mine             → your open PRs
gh issue flaky      → issues matching "flaky"
gh code "fooBar"    → code search
gh commit revert    → commit search
gh api              → pick which kind of search

Short aliases: r, p, rv, my, i, c, cm.
↩ open in browser · ⌘↩ copy URL · ⌘C copy URL

Set your org in Configure Workflow (leave it empty to search all of GitHub).</string>
